  "description": "Make every ride an unforgettable adventure with this 12 inch kids bike for girls aged 2 to 4. Built with a durable steel frame, this toddler bicycle features tool-free adjustable handlebars and seat height from 18.5 to 21.7 inches, accommodating growing children between 32 and 41 inches tall. No more fears of tipping over or scary stops—sturdy removable training wheels provide extra stability for beginner balance, while the dual braking system combines an easy rear coaster brake with a responsive front caliper handbrake. Ideal for driveway practice, park pathways, and sidewalk cruising, this adorable girl bike comes complete with a sweet bike bell, lovely front basket, frame decals, full chain guard, and wear-resistant rubber tires on a soft kid-sized saddle. It is the ultimate beginner gift for young riders.\n\nIncluded Accessories: 1 x Front Basket, 1 x Bike Bell, 2 x Mudguards (Front & Rear)\nGROWS WITH YOUR CHILD: Features tool-free adjustable seat (18.5\"-21.7\") and handlebar (24.4\"-26.8\"), perfectly fitting toddlers aged 2-4 with heights from 32\" to 41\".",
